sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Editor
    participant T as CueTable
    participant W as MainWindow
    participant C as CommandStack
    participant R as RealignJob (worker)
    participant A as Whisper backend
    participant S as Segmenter

    U->>T: edit cue text
    T-->>W: text_edited(row, text)
    W->>C: execute(EditTextCommand)
    C->>C: new text, cue locked
    U->>W: Realign Edited Cues
    W->>R: start with changed cues
    loop each changed cue
        R->>A: transcribe cue audio, text as prompt
        A-->>R: heard words
        R->>R: align corrected words to heard words
    end
    R-->>W: finished(new word timings)
    W->>C: execute(RealignCommand)
    C->>C: words replaced, cue unlocked
    U->>W: Re-segment
    W->>C: execute(ResegmentCommand)
    C->>S: segment(all words, cuts, locked cues)
    S-->>C: new cues keeping the corrections
    U->>W: Undo
    W->>C: undo()
    C-->>W: previous cues restored
